      "filename": "Cyfarthfa Iron Works - furnace bank - geograph.org.uk - 1025206.jpg",
      "title": "File:Cyfarthfa Iron Works - furnace bank - geograph.org.uk - 1025206.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/Cyfarthfa_Iron_Works_-_furnace_bank_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1025206.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cyfarthfa_Iron_Works_-_furnace_bank_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1025206.jpg",
      "width": 640,
